207:1. Each physician has an assigned panel of patients within their practice, and practice administrators manage practice accounts and panel assignments. A physician sees the full chart and clinical work for patients allowed on their panel, at most clinic demographics for practice patients off their panel, and nothing for denied or other-practice patients.
211:5. Any active practice member can invite a patient from that patient's page and invite colleague physicians to the practice. To discharge a patient, the practice asks Coda. The connection itself belongs to Connected care.
